  "title": "Oven-Roasted Ribs",
  "description": "Learn how long to cook country-style ribs in the oven at 350 degrees F with this easy recipe for slow-roasted ribs with sweet, tangy barbecue sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Christina Tabaretti"
  ],
